#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:4
msgid "Testing with WorkspaceApiMock"
msgstr "Testing with WorkspaceApiMock"

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:7
msgid "Содержание"
msgstr "Contents"

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:10
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Overview"

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:12
msgid ""
"Services that use workspace-scoped entities — such as ``ecos-uiserv`` — "
"depend on ``WorkspaceWebApi``, which calls ``ecos-model`` over HTTP to "
"resolve workspace membership. During ``@SpringBootTest`` tests ``ecos-"
"model`` is not running, so "
"``WorkspaceWebApi.waitUntilEmodelApiIsAvailable()`` loops forever and "
"tests hang indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"Services that use workspace-scoped entities — such as ``ecos-uiserv`` — "
"depend on ``WorkspaceWebApi``, which calls ``ecos-model`` over HTTP to "
"resolve workspace membership. During ``@SpringBootTest`` tests ``ecos-"
"model`` is not running, so "
"``WorkspaceWebApi.waitUntilEmodelApiIsAvailable()`` loops forever and "
"tests hang indefinitely."

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:18
msgid ""
"The ``WorkspaceApiMock`` class, provided by ``ecos-webapp-lib-spring-"
"test``, solves this problem. It implements ``WorkspaceApi`` entirely in-"
"memory, performs no HTTP calls, and is auto-discovered by Spring Boot in "
"test scope."
msgstr ""
"The ``WorkspaceApiMock`` class, provided by ``ecos-webapp-lib-spring-"
"test``, solves this problem. It implements ``WorkspaceApi`` entirely in-"
"memory, performs no HTTP calls, and is auto-discovered by Spring Boot in "
"test scope."

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:23
msgid "Problem: Hanging Tests"
msgstr "Problem: Hanging Tests"

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:25
msgid "The call chain that triggers the hang:"
msgstr "The call chain that triggers the hang:"

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:35
msgid ""
"Whenever a test exercises any code path that resolves a workspace-"
"prefixed identifier, the whole test suite will stall unless a test-safe "
"``WorkspaceApi`` implementation is present."
msgstr ""
"Whenever a test exercises any code path that resolves a workspace-"
"prefixed identifier, the whole test suite will stall unless a test-safe "
"``WorkspaceApi`` implementation is present."

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:40
msgid "Solution: WorkspaceApiMock"
msgstr "Solution: WorkspaceApiMock"

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:42
msgid ""
"``WorkspaceApiMock`` is shipped in the ``ecos-webapp-lib-spring-test`` "
"module (in ``src/main``, so it is exported as part of the module "
"artifact). It is annotated with ``@Component``, so Spring Boot's "
"component scan picks it up automatically when the module is on the test "
"classpath."
msgstr ""
"``WorkspaceApiMock`` is shipped in the ``ecos-webapp-lib-spring-test`` "
"module (in ``src/main``, so it is exported as part of the module "
"artifact). It is annotated with ``@Component``, so Spring Boot's "
"component scan picks it up automatically when the module is on the test "
"classpath."

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:47
msgid ""
"``ModelServiceFactoryInitializer`` was extended to optionally inject any "
"``WorkspaceApi`` bean:"
msgstr ""
"``ModelServiceFactoryInitializer`` was extended to optionally inject any "
"``WorkspaceApi`` bean:"

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:61
msgid ""
"When ``WorkspaceApiMock`` is present (test scope), it is injected and "
"overrides ``WorkspaceWebApi``. In production deployments — where the test"
" module is not on the classpath — ``ModelServiceFactory`` falls back to "
"the default ``WorkspaceWebApi``. No production code is affected."
msgstr ""
"When ``WorkspaceApiMock`` is present (test scope), it is injected and "
"overrides ``WorkspaceWebApi``. In production deployments — where the test"
" module is not on the classpath — ``ModelServiceFactory`` falls back to "
"the default ``WorkspaceWebApi``. No production code is affected."

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:67
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "Setup"

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:69
msgid ""
"Add ``ecos-webapp-lib-spring-test`` as a test-scoped dependency in your "
"service's ``pom.xml``:"
msgstr ""
"Add ``ecos-webapp-lib-spring-test`` as a test-scoped dependency in your "
"service's ``pom.xml``:"

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:80
msgid ""
"That is all. In any ``@SpringBootTest``, the ``WorkspaceApiMock`` bean is"
" automatically discovered and injected into ``ModelServiceFactory``. No "
"explicit ``@Import`` or additional configuration is required."
msgstr ""
"That is all. In any ``@SpringBootTest``, the ``WorkspaceApiMock`` bean is"
" automatically discovered and injected into ``ModelServiceFactory``. No "
"explicit ``@Import`` or additional configuration is required."

