#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:146
msgid ""
"``WorkspaceApiMock`` is a singleton Spring bean shared across all tests "
"in a test run. State configured in one test persists into the next. "
"**Always call** ``workspaceApiMock.clear()`` in ``@BeforeEach`` to ensure"
" test isolation."
msgstr ""
"``WorkspaceApiMock`` is a singleton Spring bean shared across all tests "
"in a test run. State configured in one test persists into the next. "
"**Always call** ``workspaceApiMock.clear()`` in ``@BeforeEach`` to ensure"
" test isolation."

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:151
msgid "Guarding Against Regressions"
msgstr "Guarding Against Regressions"

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:153
msgid ""
"To explicitly protect against any future regression that re-introduces a "
"hang, annotate time-sensitive tests with ``@Timeout``:"
msgstr ""
"To explicitly protect against any future regression that re-introduces a "
"hang, annotate time-sensitive tests with ``@Timeout``:"

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:165
msgid ""
"If the underlying code ever starts blocking again, the test will fail "
"with a timeout error rather than hanging the entire CI pipeline."
msgstr ""
"If the underlying code ever starts blocking again, the test will fail "
"with a timeout error rather than hanging the entire CI pipeline."

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:169
msgid "Module Structure Note"
msgstr "Module Structure Note"

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:171
msgid ""
"``WorkspaceApiMock`` lives in ``src/main`` of the ``ecos-webapp-lib-"
"spring-test`` module — not in ``src/test``. This distinction is "
"intentional:"
msgstr ""
"``WorkspaceApiMock`` lives in ``src/main`` of the ``ecos-webapp-lib-"
"spring-test`` module — not in ``src/test``. This distinction is "
"intentional:"

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:174
msgid ""
"**``src/main``** — code that is compiled into the module artifact and "
"exported to consumers' test classpaths."
msgstr ""
"**``src/main``** — code that is compiled into the module artifact and "
"exported to consumers' test classpaths."

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:176
msgid ""
"**``src/test``** — internal tests of the module itself (e.g., "
"``WorkspaceApiMockTest``)."
msgstr ""
"**``src/test``** — internal tests of the module itself (e.g., "
"``WorkspaceApiMockTest``)."

#: ../../general/Microservices/testing_workspace_api.rst:179
msgid ""
"Any ``@Component`` or ``@Configuration`` class that must be auto-"
"discovered by consuming services' Spring Boot tests must reside in "
"``src/main`` of the test module."
msgstr ""
"Any ``@Component`` or ``@Configuration`` class that must be auto-"
"discovered by consuming services' Spring Boot tests must reside in "
"``src/main`` of the test module."

